  "behavior_intent": [
    "Public root-namespace snapshot routes admit the real original actor under read/update ACL; internal recovery and maintenance retain root fences.",
    "Standby ACL refusal retains an affine denial capsule without transfer lease or archive capability.",
    "Leader classifies an actual bearer/ACL refusal before mandatory audit and the existing terminal clock writer; only a real receipt or strict complete NoChange can produce a Denied completion.",
    "Follower consumes the authenticated receipt, performs actual synchronization and ReadIndex, checks direct shared A-to-B or strict NoChange, then rechecks original actor and consumes the closed Denied completion.",
    "Existing physical-seal reader is moved to the held SnapshotSpool; SnapshotLease delegates to the same implementation.",
    "Historical public snapshot restore uses the original update ACL and explicit POST/PUT upload route rather than a blanket root-token guard."
  ],
